arition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Soldier'. The histories write: 'Upon the peaks was the beast cornered and killed.' It was the battlefield where the Feranmut was hunted, and where countless soldiers were buried. Swords and spears lie buried, and tears of blood have stopped flowing. The bleached bones shall know spring no more.","abilities":["Vanishes when encountering another type of enemy, granting the target a portion of this unit's ATK, DEF, and RES, stacking up to 3 times per unit"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5400,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"uproot_mountain_overshadow":{"slug":"uproot_mountain_overshadow","name":"Uproot Mountain - Overshadow","icon":"/enemies-icons/Uproot Mountain - Overshadow.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Strength'. The histories write: 'Cold wind howls, for the brave never returned.' Their names are forgotten to history, and the nation is not yet secure. Even as their strength holds, they shall never find their way home.","abilities":["Damage from Stamp reduced","When on a Glyph Tile, disables stamp effects for all glyphs on current tile and all connected Glyph Tiles"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":800,"def":1550,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.8}},"raise_tide_summon":{"slug":"raise_tide_summon","name":"Raise Tide - Summon","icon":"/enemies-icons/Raise Tide - Summon.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Brush'. At the end of the history book is a comment in dried ink: 'Spring and autumn are not me. How could they know how long the night is?' If history can be altered, and writing forged, who will seek justice for the innumerable souls lost to the ages?","abilities":["Writes the glyph Soldier when first entering an empty Glyph Tile"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":9600,"atk":300,"def":100,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4.5}},"ribbon_in_the_waves_rust":{"slug":"ribbon_in_the_waves_rust","name":"Ribbon in the Waves - Rust","icon":"/enemies-icons/Ribbon in the Waves - Rust.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Falsehood'. 'He who claims himself pure should be cast into murky waters.' Purity and corruption, truth and falsehood, are never easy to tell. Who can tell if the words of the swimming fins are true?","abilities":["Can move through empty Glyph Tiles","Exits glyph form when stamped by a Stamp, becoming stunned, and cannot turn back to glyph form for a while","Cannot be teleported"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":650,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png","act49side_token_draft":"/item-icons/draft_of_history.png"},"previewFile":"ta-s-1.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[11,3],[10,2],[9,1],[8,1],[7,1],[6,1],[5,1],[4,1],[4,2],[4,3],[5,3],[6,3]],"distances":[0,1.4142135623730951,2.8284271247461903,3.8284271247461903,4.82842712474619,5.82842712474619,6.82842712474619,7.82842712474619,8.82842712474619,9.82842712474619,10.8284271247461